  "body": "## What changed\nOne line of one example file is removed: `examples/first-router-part.nc`, line 82, the second `T2 M6`.\n\n## Why\nPR #3464 (issue #3445) makes the grbl-family posts skip the tool call of a repeated tool. The section \"2D Contour1\" keeps the tool T2 of the section \"2D Pocket1\". The post is correct. The shipped example was stale, and `main` was red.\n\n## Test result\n- `first_part_programs`: 2 passed (`first_part_posts_the_shipped_program`, `first_router_part_posts_the_shipped_program`).\n- `first_router_part`: 4 passed. `grblhal_post`: 9 passed. `router_kind`: 4 passed. `cutting_router`: 5 passed.\n- Run with `cargo xtask gate batch --only ...`. No heavy lane ran.\n\nNo post script changed.\n\nChangelog: none\n\nRefs #3464\nRefs #3521\nFixes #3572\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
